{"id":"torrey:babylon","source":"torrey","name":"Babylon","slug":"babylon","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"Origin of — Ge 10:8,10.","refs":[["Gen",10,8,10,8],["Gen",10,10,10,10]]},{"text":"Origin of the name — Ge 11:8,9.","refs":[["Gen",11,8,11,8],["Gen",11,9,11,9]]},{"text":"Land of the Chaldeans. — Eze 12:13.","refs":[["Ezek",12,13,12,13]]},{"text":"Land of Shinar. — Da 1:2; Zec 5:11.","refs":[["Dan",1,2,1,2],["Zech",5,11,5,11]]},{"text":"Land of Merathaim. — Jer 50:1,21.","refs":[["Jer",50,1,50,1],["Jer",50,21,50,21]]},{"text":"Desert of the sea. — Isa 21:1,9.","refs":[["Isa",21,1,21,1],["Isa",21,9,21,9]]},{"text":"Sheshach. — Jer 25:12,26.","refs":[["Jer",25,12,25,12],["Jer",25,26,25,26]]},{"text":"Lady of kingdoms. — Isa 47:5.","refs":[["Isa",47,5,47,5]]},{"text":"Situated beyond the Euphrates — Ge 11:31; Jos 24:2,3.","refs":[["Gen",11,31,11,31],["Josh",24,2,24,2],["Josh",24,3,24,3]]},{"text":"Formerly a part of Mesopotamia — Ac 7:2.","refs":[["Acts",7,2,7,2]]},{"text":"Founded by the Assyrians, and a part of their empire — 2Ki 17:24; Isa 23:13.","refs":[["2Kgs",17,24,17,24],["Isa",23,13,23,13]]},{"text":"Watered by the rivers Euphrates and Tigris — Ps 137:1; Jer 51:13.","refs":[["Ps",137,1,137,1],["Jer",51,13,51,13]]},{"text":"Composed of many nations — Da 3:4; 3:29.","refs":[["Dan",3,4,3,4],["Dan",3,29,3,29]]},{"text":"Governed by Kings — 2Ki 20:12; Da 5:1.","refs":[["2Kgs",20,12,20,12],["Dan",5,1,5,1]]},{"text":"With Media and Persia divided by Darius 120 provinces — Da 6:1.","refs":[["Dan",6,1,6,1]]},{"text":"Presidents placed over — Da 2:48; 6:1.","refs":[["Dan",2,48,2,48],["Dan",6,1,6,1]]},{"text":"Babylon the chief province of — Da 3:1.","refs":[["Dan",3,1,3,1]]},{"text":"Its antiquity. — Ge 11:4,9.","refs":[["Gen",11,4,11,4],["Gen",11,9,11,9]]},{"text":"Enlarged by Nebuchadnezzar. — Da 4:30.","refs":[["Dan",4,30,4,30]]},{"text":"Surrounded with a great wall and fortified. — Jer 51:53,58.","refs":[["Jer",51,53,51,53],["Jer",51,58,51,58]]},{"text":"Called the golden city. — Isa 14:4.","refs":[["Isa",14,4,14,4]]},{"text":"Called the glory of kingdoms. — Isa 13:19.","refs":[["Isa",13,19,13,19]]},{"text":"Called beauty of Chaldees, &c. — Isa 13:19.","refs":[["Isa",13,19,13,19]]},{"text":"Called the city of merchants. — Eze 17:4.","refs":[["Ezek",17,4,17,4]]},{"text":"Called Babylon the great. — Da 4:30.","refs":[["Dan",4,30,4,30]]},{"text":"Antiquity. — Jer 5:15.","refs":[["Jer",5,15,5,15]]},{"text":"Naval power. — Isa 43:14.","refs":[["Isa",43,14,43,14]]},{"text":"Military power. — Jer 5:16; 50:23.","refs":[["Jer",5,16,5,16],["Jer",50,23,50,23]]},{"text":"National greatness. — Isa 13:19; Jer 51:41.","refs":[["Isa",13,19,13,19],["Jer",51,41,51,41]]},{"text":"Wealth. — Jer 50:37; 51:13.","refs":[["Jer",50,37,50,37],["Jer",51,13,51,13]]},{"text":"Commerce. — Eze 17:4.","refs":[["Ezek",17,4,17,4]]},{"text":"Manufacture of garments. — Jos 7:21.","refs":[["Josh",7,21,7,21]]},{"text":"Wisdom of senators. — Isa 47:10; Jer 50:35.","refs":[["Isa",47,10,47,10],["Jer",50,35,50,35]]},{"text":"Idolatrous. — Jer 50:38; Da 3:18.","refs":[["Jer",50,38,50,38],["Dan",3,18,3,18]]},{"text":"Addicted to magic. — Isa 47:9,12,13; Da 2:1,2.","refs":[["Isa",47,9,47,9],["Isa",47,12,47,12],["Isa",47,13,47,13],["Dan",2,1,2,1],["Dan",2,2,2,2]]},{"text":"Profane and sacrilegious. — Da 5:1-3.","refs":[["Dan",5,1,5,3]]},{"text":"Wicked. — Isa 47:10.","refs":[["Isa",47,10,47,10]]},{"text":"Arrogant. — Isa 14:13,14; Jer 50:29,31,32.","refs":[["Isa",14,13,14,13],["Isa",14,14,14,14],["Jer",50,29,50,29],["Jer",50,31,50,31],["Jer",50,32,50,32]]},{"text":"Secure and self-confident. — Isa 47:7,8.","refs":[["Isa",47,7,47,7],["Isa",47,8,47,8]]},{"text":"Grand and stately. — Isa 47:1,5.","refs":[["Isa",47,1,47,1],["Isa",47,5,47,5]]},{"text":"Covetous. — Jer 51:13.","refs":[["Jer",51,13,51,13]]},{"text":"Oppressive. — Isa 14:4.","refs":[["Isa",14,4,14,4]]},{"text":"Cruel and destructive. — Isa 14:17; 47:6; Jer 51:25; Hab 1:6,7.","refs":[["Isa",14,17,14,17],["Isa",47,6,47,6],["Jer",51,25,51,25],["Hab",1,6,1,6],["Hab",1,7,1,7]]},{"text":"An instrument of God’s vengeance on other nations. — Jer 51:7; Isa 47:6.","refs":[["Jer",51,7,51,7],["Isa",47,6,47,6]]},{"text":"Languages spoken in — Da 1:4; 2:4.","refs":[["Dan",1,4,1,4],["Dan",2,4,2,4]]},{"text":"Armies of, described — Hab 1:7-9.","refs":[["Hab",1,7,1,9]]},{"text":"A great eagle. — Eze 17:3.","refs":[["Ezek",17,3,17,3]]},{"text":"A head of gold. — Da 2:32,37,38.","refs":[["Dan",2,32,2,32],["Dan",2,37,2,37],["Dan",2,38,2,38]]},{"text":"A lion with eagle’s wings. — Da 7:4.","refs":[["Dan",7,4,7,4]]},{"text":"Ambassadors of, sent to Hezekiah — 2Ki 20:12.","refs":[["2Kgs",20,12,20,12]]},{"text":"Made Jehoiakim tributary. — 2Ki 24:1.","refs":[["2Kgs",24,1,24,1]]},{"text":"Besieged Jerusalem. — 2Ki 24:10,11.","refs":[["2Kgs",24,10,24,10],["2Kgs",24,11,24,11]]},{"text":"Took Jehoiachin, &c captive to Babylon. — 2Ki 24:12,14-16; 2Ch 36:10.","refs":[["2Kgs",24,12,24,12],["2Kgs",24,14,24,16],["2Chr",36,10,36,10]]},{"text":"Spoiled the temple. — 2Ki 24:13.","refs":[["2Kgs",24,13,24,13]]},{"text":"Made Zedekiah king. — 2Ki 24:17.","refs":[["2Kgs",24,17,24,17]]},{"text":"Rebelled against by Zedekiah. — 2Ki 24:20.","refs":[["2Kgs",24,20,24,20]]},{"text":"Besieged and took Jerusalem. — 2Ki 25:1-4.","refs":[["2Kgs",25,1,25,4]]},{"text":"Burned Jerusalem, &c. — 2Ki 25:9,10.","refs":[["2Kgs",25,9,25,9],["2Kgs",25,10,25,10]]},{"text":"Took Zedekiah, &c captive to Babylon. — 2Ki 25:7,11,18-21; 2Ch 36:20.","refs":[["2Kgs",25,7,25,7],["2Kgs",25,11,25,11],["2Kgs",25,18,25,21],["2Chr",36,20,36,20]]},{"text":"Spoiled and burned the temple. — 2Ki 25:9,13-17; 2Ch 36:18,19.","refs":[["2Kgs",25,9,25,9],["2Kgs",25,13,25,17],["2Chr",36,18,36,18],["2Chr",36,19,36,19]]},{"text":"Revolt of the Jews from, and their punishment illustrated — Eze 17:1-24.","refs":[["Ezek",17,1,17,24]]},{"text":"The Jews exhorted to be subject to, and settle in — Jer 27:17; 29:1-7.","refs":[["Jer",27,17,27,17],["Jer",29,1,29,7]]},{"text":"Treatment of the Jews in — 2Ki 25:27-30; Da 1:3-7.","refs":[["2Kgs",25,27,25,30],["Dan",1,3,1,7]]},{"text":"Grief of the Jews in — Ps 137:1-6.","refs":[["Ps",137,1,137,6]]},{"text":"Destroyed by the Medes — Da 5:30,31.","refs":[["Dan",5,30,5,30],["Dan",5,31,5,31]]},{"text":"Restoration of the Jews from — 2Ch 36:23; Ezr 1:1-2:67.","refs":[["2Chr",36,23,36,23],["Ezra",1,1,2,67]]},{"text":"The gospel preached in — 1Pe 5:13.","refs":[["1Pet",5,13,5,13]]},{"text":"A type of Antichrist — Re 16:19; 17:5.","refs":[["Rev",16,19,16,19],["Rev",17,5,17,5]]},{"text":"Conquests by. — Jer 21:3-10; 27:2-6; 49:28-33; Eze 21:19-32; 29:18-20.","refs":[["Jer",21,3,21,10],["Jer",27,2,27,6],["Jer",49,28,49,33],["Ezek",21,19,21,32],["Ezek",29,18,29,20]]},{"text":"Captivity of the Jews by. — Jer 20:4-6; 22:20-26; 25:9-11; Mic 4:10.","refs":[["Jer",20,4,20,6],["Jer",22,20,22,26],["Jer",25,9,25,11],["Mic",4,10,4,10]]},{"text":"Restoration of the Jews from. — Isa 14:1-4; 44:28; 48:20; Jer 29:10; 50:4,8,19.","refs":[["Isa",14,1,14,4],["Isa",44,28,44,28],["Isa",48,20,48,20],["Jer",29,10,29,10],["Jer",50,4,50,4],["Jer",50,8,50,8],["Jer",50,19,50,19]]},{"text":"Destruction of. — Isa 13:1-22; 14:4-22; 21:1-10; 47:1-15; Jer 25:12; 50:1-51:64.","refs":[["Isa",13,1,13,22],["Isa",14,4,14,22],["Isa",21,1,21,10],["Isa",47,1,47,15],["Jer",25,12,25,12],["Jer",50,1,51,64]]},{"text":"Perpetual desolation of. — Isa 13:19-22; 14:22,23; Jer 50:13,39; 51:37.","refs":[["Isa",13,19,13,22],["Isa",14,22,14,22],["Isa",14,23,14,23],["Jer",50,13,50,13],["Jer",50,39,50,39],["Jer",51,37,51,37]]},{"text":"Preaching of the gospel in. — Ps 87:4.","refs":[["Ps",87,4,87,4]]}],"refCount":150}
